title: The pin yields to the crack
story: thealderman
author: Sharpee Team
description: ADR-318 D9 seam-4 contract (ruling 2026-08-16) — the pin
  holds the maintained lie consistent only below breaking. A player who
  heard the whereabouts lie FIRST (pinning the very fact the confession
  claims) still gets the confession at breaking: the pin stops gating
  through the crack. Before the fix this path deflected forever.

---

> south
[OK: contains "Ballroom"]

# The whereabouts lie is told first — minting the pin on the same fact
# the confession will claim (whereabouts: theatre vs ballroom)
> ask viola about the alibi
[OK: contains "McVicker's"]

# Four more maintained lies climb the curve to breaking (15..75)
> ask viola about the killer
[OK: contains "Some accident"]

> ask viola about the killer
[OK: contains "Some accident"]

> ask viola about the killer
[OK: contains "Some accident"]

> ask viola about the killer
[OK: contains "Some accident"]

# At breaking the pin no longer gates: the confession claims the pinned
# fact's true value and still escapes
> ask viola about the truth
[OK: contains "the cord was in my hands"]
[OK: not contains "a role like any other"]
